# L §8 and §8.3: a load refusal in a scenario file refuses only that scenario; the base's asks are answered as the
# base alone answers them (fault, writer 7: the base ask was refused with an internal KeyError after the scenario's
# load reset the currency table). `minor(DUK)` is DUK's declared minor unit, 0.01 DUK (L §5.4).
=== m.tally
model f
  tally 2
  on 2025-01-01
  start 2025-01-01
  end 2025-12-31
source s "synthetic"
unit DUK: currency minor 0.01
ask q: minor(DUK)
=== bad.tally
scenario bad over f
  tally 2
  from 2025-01-01
def q: int = 1
=== expect
scenario bad: refused: LOAD-DUP q is declared twice (bad.tally:4)
q: 0.01 DUK
  cut 2025-01-01
